  "id": 19,
  "name": "local_distance_with_regret_progress",
  "intent": "Combine local distance as the primary driver with a bounded regret term to prioritize isolated close nodes, and add a progress-scaled penalty on return distance to favor candidates near the start as the tour nears completion, aiming to reduce backtracking and improve tour closure.",
